	(text "Line 2 + microSD together: U6 (TCA9534A, I2C 0x38) drives line 2's SLIC.\nLeave J5 open when U6 is fitted (J5 = line 2 on GPIO18-21 instead of the card).\n~INT unused: firmware polls SHK. R18/R19 keep F/R and RM low until U6 is set up.\nJ10: P7 (EXP_4) stays on U6; P4-P6 carry LOAD_EN, CHG# and PGOOD# for the battery."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 274.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4c964da6-479b-49d8-94ff-0116676c11b2")
	)
