	)
	(text "Battery power. U8 (BQ24072) takes VBUS_IN (J1 through D1 and the U7 input switch, or the DevKit USB 5V pin) and makes SYS = battery + 0.225 V.\nInput limit 1550/R23 = 1.4 A (two lines), charge current 890/R24 = 490 mA. J12: 1 BAT+, 2 NTC, 3 BAT-.\nCut JP4 when the cell has its own NTC (otherwise R22 stands in for it)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "72fcf4d4-8eb0-44fb-9cd8-18f04f11fdd1")
	)
	(text "SYS feeds U9 (3.3 V), the BM64 LDO U5, J10 and J11.\nQ1 switches the SLIC supply (SLIC_VCC) for both lines;\nU6 P4 (LOAD_EN) turns it on via Q2.\nU6 P5/P6 read U8 CHG#/PGOOD#; P7 (EXP_4) is the one J10 pin left on U6.\nU11 (TCA9534A, I2C 0x3C, optional) drives J10's other three pins (EXP_1 to EXP_3).\nJ11 (side-entry JST): 1 SYS, 2 +3.3V, 3 SDA, 4 SCL, 5 GND.\nU6 P0-P3 drive line 2's SLIC. U10 reports the cell level (I2C 0x36)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 272.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "264ff31b-6610-41da-a4ed-154946325a71")
	)
